      "content": "it’s just that there’s no end in sight. every morning i wake up and the first thing i feel is this crushing dread because i know exactly what the next 16 hours look like. i'm just so tired of being the one who has to be strong all the time. i'm so exhausted that even thinking about tomorrow feels impossible.",
